1
00:00:00,449 --> 00:00:01,649
(Penny:)Oh, don't worry, I won't.

2
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:02,820
(Amy:)Thanks.

3
00:00:04,353 --> 00:00:08,153
"The woman at the wall store?"
Let it go!

4
00:00:10,359 --> 00:00:12,089
(Sheldon:)Are you going to confront Penny?

5
00:00:12,094 --> 00:00:13,664
(Leonard:)Eventually, I guess.

6
00:00:13,662 --> 00:00:16,062
(Leonard:)Although, I am kind of curious
how long she thinks

7
00:00:16,065 --> 00:00:18,135
(Leonard:)she can keep hiding my stuff
without me knowing.

8
00:00:18,133 --> 00:00:19,833
(Sheldon:)Hmm.

9
00:00:19,835 --> 00:00:23,005
(Sheldon:)You know, perhaps
instead of confronting them,

10
00:00:23,005 --> 00:00:24,905
(Sheldon:)we should see how far
they're willing to spin

11
00:00:24,907 --> 00:00:26,437
(Sheldon:)their tangled webs.

12
00:00:26,442 --> 00:00:28,042
(Sheldon:)Like that
Spider-Man action figure

13
00:00:28,043 --> 00:00:30,713
(Sheldon:)that used to be on your desk.

14
00:00:30,713 --> 00:00:33,583
(Leonard:)Oh, my God, I'm going blind.

15
00:00:34,483 --> 00:00:36,483
(Sheldon:)Hi.
Food's here.

16
00:00:36,485 --> 00:00:38,285
(Howard:)Oh.

17
00:00:38,287 --> 00:00:39,157
(Sheldon:)Excellent.

18
00:00:39,154 --> 00:00:41,624
(Sheldon:)I'm very hungry.

19
00:00:41,623 --> 00:00:42,693
Yeah, speaking of which,

20
00:00:42,691 --> 00:00:44,591
(Sheldon:)what's going on
with your apartment?

21
00:00:44,593 --> 00:00:48,333
(Amy:)Oh, uh, they're still
working on it.

22
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:49,530
(Sheldon:)Interesting.

23
00:00:49,531 --> 00:00:52,101
(Sheldon:)Very interesting.

24
00:00:53,902 --> 00:00:55,802
(Penny:)Yeah, we swung by her apartment
on the way to the restaurant,

25
00:00:55,804 --> 00:00:57,104
(Penny:)and they're gonna be fixing it
for a while.

26
00:00:57,106 --> 00:01:00,946
(Sheldon:)Wait, uh...
you saw her apartment?

